title: PHCSSM
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the paper it accompanies.
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-10-12"
license: PolyForm-Noncommercial-1.0.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/phclab/PHCSSM"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of PHCSSM, a spiking state-space model carrying five
  biological constraints inside a fully parallelizable recurrence. The temporal
  recurrences are evaluated by a log-domain prefix scan, and spatial coupling is
  settled on a second axis, the within-timestep transmission loop.
